{%- comment -%}
  House of Agha · About 02b · Composed in Hyderabad
  The house's city, told through its own lines: a Charminar line drawing (drawn by hand as
  paths, not a photo) that draws itself as the section scrolls in, the city's name in Urdu
  (حیدرآباد) behind it, a Deccan jaali lattice (assets/hoa-jaali.svg) along the card edge,
  and three heritage notes (blocks). Complete and fully drawn without JS; motion in
  assets/hoa-about.js (initHyderabad). Copy is city heritage, editable in the theme editor.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign s = section.settings -%}
{%- if s.urdu != blank -%}
